{"pin":"BH00160","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00160","anchor":"","first_line":"Glory be to Thee, O Lord my God! Thou hearest how I weep with a weeping like that of a mother bereaved of her child...So grievous hath been My weeping that I have been prevented from making mention of Thee and singing Thy praises","first_line_orig":"سبحانک اللهم یا الهی تسمع حنینی کحنین الثکلی و طرفی الی الافق الاعلی تری و  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"3310","full_text_parts":["Glory be to Thee, O Lord my God! Make manifest the rivers of Thy sovereign might, that the waters of Thy Unity may flow through the inmost realities of all things, in such wise that the banner of Thine unfailing guidance may be raised aloft in the kingdom of Thy command and the stars of Thy divine splendor may shine brightly in the heaven of Thy majesty. Potent art Thou to do what pleaseth Thee. Thou, verily, art the Help in Peril, the Self-Subsisting."],"translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15739.051","source":"BLIB_Or15739","locator":"051"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA48:019","source":"INBA48","locator":"019","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v048/?page=21"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA49:238","source":"INBA49","locator":"238","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v049/?page=240"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA92:223b","source":"INBA92","locator":"223b","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v092-dark/?page=114"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.002","source":"AHM","locator":"002","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-2.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT1.136x","source":"ASAT1","locator":"136x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/427.pdf#page=74"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT2.103x","source":"ASAT2","locator":"103x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/428.pdf#page=53"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT5.349x","source":"ASAT5","locator":"349x","url":"https: